# ============================================================
# NaturalEventImpact_Flow.graph
# Unity Visual Scripting  –  FlowGraph Node Specification
#
# ARCHITECTURE CONTRACT:
#   Physics.OverlapSphere + HashSet dedup in Impact(),
#   Vector3.MoveTowards in Update(), and warning-marker
#   instantiation stay in C#. VS reads HasImpacted and
#   DamageRadius for reactive branching.
#
# NODE MAP:
#   [Update] → [GetComponent<NaturalEventImpact>]
#     → [GetMember: HasImpacted]
#     → [Branch: HasImpacted AND NOT prevImpacted]
#       True → [Trigger Custom Event "OnNaturalEventImpacted"]
#   [Set Variable: prevImpacted = HasImpacted]
#
# CUSTOM EVENTS:
#   "OnNaturalEventImpacted" → screen shake, camera rumble, HUD flash
#
# MACHINE SETUP:
#   ScriptMachine on NaturalEventImpact prefab root
# ============================================================